    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d778">

                <pb facs="0742" n="626" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg626"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.1100 K77/64.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-02-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 29, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary regrets to find that the limited time and his duty to return home
                    by a fixed date unfortunately prevent his going to Tegucigalpa. He will arrive
                    on the eighth and remain the ninth, and plans to invite Government officials and
                    others to entertainment on board the <hi rendition="#italic">Maryland.</hi>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
